   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default"> US servicemen line up during the official opening ceremony of the joint US-Georgia military exercise 'Noble Partner 2015' at the military base of Vaziani outside Tbilisi, Georgia, 11 May 2015. Exercise Noble Partner is a bilateral effort focused on enhancing US and Georgian NATO Response Force interoperability in the context of military-to-military relationships, the United States Army Europe says on its website. It involves some 600 Georgian and US service members.(AP  Photo)  Shakh  Aivazov</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
